  "intuition": "Combine the linear gap weighting with a monotone sigmoid transform to emphasize moderate gaps while suppressing very small or large ones, adding a stable clamp schedule to ensure weights stay within meaningful bounds. This balances the original gap linear idea with a smooth nonlinear transform to improve robustness and stability.",
  "hyperparams": {
